{"chunk_id": "f18790096e0e", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "", "text": "两大航运集团介绍\n中国两大央企航运集团 ——中远海运（全球综合运力第一）、招商局（中国第二、能源运输龙头），构成中国航运 “双航母” 格局。\n一、中国远洋海运集团（中远海运，COSCO SHIPPING）", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "f18790096e0e", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "222fb3128834", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "基本概况", "date_hint": "", "text": "成立：2016 年由中远集团 + 中海集团重组，总部上海，国务院国资委直管副部级央企。\n定位：全球综合航运绝对龙头，“航运 + 港口 + 物流 + 金融 + 装备” 全产业链生态。\n规模（2024 年末）：1535 艘船、1.29 亿载重吨，全球综合运力第一。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "222fb3128834", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "a0f936ccfa95", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心业务与船队（2024）", "date_hint": "", "text": "集装箱：542 艘、338.8 万 TEU，全球第四、中国第一。\n干散货：468 艘、4982.6 万载重吨，全球第一。\n油 / 气：251 艘、3280 万载重吨，全球第一。\n特种船：207 艘、788.3 万载重吨，全球第一（半潜船、重吊船）。\n港口：控股 / 参股全球39 个港口、375 个泊位，年处理能力1.24 亿 TEU。\n物流 / 金融 / 装备：全球端到端物流、航运租赁、船舶修造、集装箱制造。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a0f936ccfa95", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "8d2dc1150d44", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心优势", "date_hint": "", "text": "规模碾压：综合运力、干散货、油运、特种船四项全球第一。\n网络最强：“一带一路” 关键港口布局（希腊比雷埃夫斯、阿布扎比、秘鲁钱凯）。\n绿色数智：32 艘甲醇双燃料船、LNG 动力船占比 32%；航运大模型、区块链提单。\n上市平台：中远海控（集运）、中远海能（油运）、中远海特（特种船）、中远海发（租赁）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "8d2dc1150d44", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "fa969864dad6", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "基本概况", "date_hint": "", "text": "成立：1872 年（轮船招商局），2015 年吸收合并中外运长航，总部香港 + 深圳，国资委直管副部级央企。\n定位：百年航运祖业、能源运输 + 港口物流双强，“交通物流 + 综合金融 + 城市开发” 三大板块。\n规模（2024 年末）：546 艘船、4444 万载重吨，中国第二、全球前列。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "fa969864dad6", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "46c31d233104", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心业务与船队（2024–2026）", "date_hint": "", "text": "油轮：52 艘 VLCC（全球第一）、7 艘 Aframax，总运力1688 万吨。\n干散货：37 艘 VLOC（全球第一）、104 艘散货船，总运力3200 万吨。\nLNG：国内领先，37 艘在建，绑定长期项目、利润稳定。\n集装箱：中外运集运，亚太区域航线龙头。\n内河 / 滚装：长航集团（长江最大内河航运）、滚装船队（汽车出口主力）。\n港口：全球50 个港口，2024 年集装箱吞吐量1.3 亿 TEU（全球占比 18%）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "46c31d233104", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "e6180cd8b0f6", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心优势", "date_hint": "", "text": "能源王者：VLCC、VLOC双项全球第一，油轮运力占全国沿海 28%。\n江海联运：远洋 + 沿海 + 长江全程物流，“长江国家队”。\n全牌照金融：招商金控（首家央企金控）、招商银行，赋能航运。\n上市平台：招商轮船（油 / 散 / 气 / 集）、招商南油（成品油）、中国外运（综合物流）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "e6180cd8b0f6", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
